s practice the habits that make audio usable in the edit."}]}, {"id": "759bd351-6336-424b-a695-761e03461c22", "type": "topic", "title": "Pre-Production, Producing, Scheduling, and Production Management", "description": "Plan a project through script breakdowns, budgets, schedules, locations, permissions, risk, and crew logistics.", "children": [{"id": "1afe9ad6-4391-4dc0-a94d-a1a8366cdef2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Development and feasibility", "children": [{"id": "ac4eb37c-1606-460b-9cc9-4b463e6de75d", "type": "concept", "title": "Concept, logline, treatment, proposal, audience, scope, constraints, and deliverables"}, {"id": "ab9a3cc0-ad2b-41d3-a450-6f0f9ab7db1e", "type": "concept", "title": "Choosing locations, subjects, cast, crew, props, gear, and production approach"}, {"id": "e2e576f6-04c7-4bd9-a1e7-d19fd9aefff6", "type": "concept", "title": "Balancing ambition with time, access, budget, skill level, and risk"}], "description": "Pre-production teaches students to shape good ideas into projects that can actually be made well."}, {"id": "a6d161dd-a4b9-4323-8ad5-499720e2335d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Planning documents", "children": [{"id": "deff805f-61ed-41c7-a271-4b285b5975ca", "type": "concept", "title": "Script breakdown, shot list, storyboard, call sheet, production schedule, budget, gear list, and contact sheet"}, {"id": "f0303031-00c2-470d-bf0c-96a20285ed6c", "type": "concept", "title": "Location scout notes, release forms, risk assessment, insurance basics, and contingency plans"}, {"id": "f3a92a17-33a9-4b4e-8960-bb24f06f33c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Crew communication, file sharing, and decision tracking"}], "description": "Professional productions rely on clear documents that let teams coordinate under pressure."}, {"id": "685d47d5-6acc-4e08-aa96-57b716fe0938", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Production management", "children": [{"id": "aa67e495-d039-4e94-9e01-eeee89a91039", "type": "concept", "title": "Scheduling, meals, transportation, 